    "b0006-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "7a1a1af4dd942d1e6738dfa823625c5edf13948fd903589cf2290322611efe0e",
      "targetHash": "fbc8d1a6f8f5afc6bbe1459c0b4032b31be222786e2cd7195ada959e5ea47792",
      "machineHash": "fbc8d1a6f8f5afc6bbe1459c0b4032b31be222786e2cd7195ada959e5ea47792",
      "machineText": "在 v1 中，许多用户希望能更精细地控制窗口本身。我很高兴地宣布，现在已有专为此用途设计的新运行时 API。它功能丰富，并支持多显示器配置。此外，对话框 API 也得到了改进：现在，你可以使用现代化的原生对话框，并通过丰富的配置满足各种对话框需求。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "There were a huge number of requests in v1 for the ability to have greater\\ control of the window it…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
