    "b0008-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "75850d60f7c5d266b05c5a27c7770661e5eacb4b662a43545782f84fbead8199",
      "targetHash": "23d7698b9b03f98c31a411ec105b7fbd64331d7efec009e723c9a2c8edeaa866",
      "machineHash": "23d7698b9b03f98c31a411ec105b7fbd64331d7efec009e723c9a2c8edeaa866",
      "machineText": "v1 的一大痛点是必须将整个应用程序压缩成单个 JS 文件和单个 CSS 文件。我很高兴地宣布，在 v2 中完全不再要求以任何形式捆绑资源。想加载本地图像？使用带有本地 src 路径的`\u003c../../../assets/blog-images\u003e`标签即可。想使用一款很酷的字体？将它复制进来，然后在 CSS 中添加其路径即可。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "A huge pain-point of v1 was the need to condense your entire application down to\\ single JS \u0026 CSS fi…",
