      "targetHash": "551be89efd7c811babb7a239df329c29e60948e2e387044ade1d3e7220709763",
      "machineHash": "551be89efd7c811babb7a239df329c29e60948e2e387044ade1d3e7220709763",
      "machineText": "那么，我该如何加入自己的资源？",
      "status": "final",
