      "machineHash": "d28a83c04a87f8b96a47676137ddf0ee82cfb59a14cea3d5b281f4cb24c0f7b7",
      "machineText": "自动重新构建——Go 代码发生任何变化时，应用程序都会重新构建并重新启动",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "Auto rebuild - Any changes to your Go code will rebuild and relaunch your application",
      "provider": "codex",
