    "b0018-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "f197c0f9e5f5cf10e17ca7feff17b0cd8f0e4c598847e9fc5e008e7e913bd1c2",
      "targetHash": "673a8b34b6589c284e1bbf1a3e52c5430d101f77732dc721b6ee5b1e2eeba5da",
      "machineHash": "673a8b34b6589c284e1bbf1a3e52c5430d101f77732dc721b6ee5b1e2eeba5da",
      "machineText": "此外，还会在端口34115上启动一个 Web 服务器。任何连接到该服务器的浏览器都可以访问你的应用程序。所有已连接的 Web 浏览器都会响应系统事件，例如资源变更时的热重载。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "In addition to this, a webserver will start on port 34115. This will serve your\\ application to any …",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:47Z"
    },
    "b0019-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "d011d90fb9ff0557dec77e87205e0636f2d1cf1b5ab76a9238bd390f6dad3631",
      "targetHash": "2270cbbafd92090b0035d6fc6d1407ec6cfb1fd476dfa22547fdc6912ee6a55e",
      "machineHash": "2270cbbafd92090b0035d6fc6d1407ec6cfb1fd476dfa22547fdc6912ee6a55e",
      "machineText": "使用 Go 开发应用程序时，我们经常处理结构体。我们往往需要将结构体发送到前端，并将其用作应用程序的状态。在 v1 中，这一过程高度依赖手动操作，给开发者带来了一些负担。我很高兴地宣布，在 v2 中，以开发模式运行任何应用程序时，都会为绑定方法用作输入或输出参数的所有结构体自动生成 TypeScript 模型。这使两个环境之间的数据模型能够无缝互通。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "In Go, we are used to dealing with structs in our applications. It's often\\ useful to send structs t…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:47Z"
    },
    "b0020-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "e4a6145b3a813cb9128eeed038c86ca46725187be24a9bb2ca09de244178097b",
      "targetHash": "1c74cdbb8bd4e2f3fcfdfbe84151e6835f88f8e52c1f8b0a53b1d0887b0e3fed",
      "machineHash": "1c74cdbb8bd4e2f3fcfdfbe84151e6835f88f8e52c1f8b0a53b1d0887b0e3fed",
      "machineText": "此外，还会动态生成另一个 JS 模块，用于封装所有绑定方法。它会为这些方法提供 JSDoc，从而让 IDE 能够提供代码补全和提示。在封装 Go 代码的自动生成模块中按 Tab 键时，数据模型会自动导入，这真的很酷！",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "In addition to this, another JS module is dynamically generated wrapping all\\ your bound methods. Th…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:47Z"
