    "b0023-text-01": {
      "sourceHash": "721e813afcbd80a8d17de197ccf2f10bff249a89c4365ad5c2e3a492b2efb8ea",
      "targetHash": "d84759a8d9b311104a12efe364a35c7e1e98f9b793bd3dc2c6577a68ddf2e3ac",
      "machineHash": "d84759a8d9b311104a12efe364a35c7e1e98f9b793bd3dc2c6577a68ddf2e3ac",
      "machineText": "快速启动并运行应用程序一直是 Wails 项目的核心目标。项目刚推出时，我们试图涵盖当时的许多现代框架：react、vue 和 angular。前端开发领域观点纷呈、变化迅速，很难持续紧跟其发展！因此，我们发现基础模板很快就会过时，维护起来令人头疼。这也意味着，我们没有适用于最新优秀技术栈的现代化模板。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "Getting an application up and running quickly was always a key goal for the\\ Wails project. When we …",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:47Z"
    },
    "b0024-text-01": {
