      "machineHash": "e584701f8a3727672271108458ee5694155a544e218e8efb45723fd318f14ed9",
      "machineText": "正如我在 Windows 发行说明中所说，Wails v2 为项目奠定了新的基础。此次发布旨在收集大家对新方案的反馈，并在正式发布前解决所有错误。非常欢迎你的意见！请将任何反馈提交到[v2 测试版](https://github.com/wailsapp/wails/discussions/828)讨论区。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "As I'd said in the Windows release notes, Wails v2 represents a new foundation\\ for the project. The…",
      "provider": "codex",
