      "machineHash": "fb70a669ebbf1b429a8c3130d1aaad02ae5acc8596f71fc0beeaded9c3f65e55",
      "machineText": "Linux 的支持*很难*实现。我们预计测试版会存在一些特殊问题。请提交详细的错误报告，帮助我们更好地帮助你！",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "Linux is *hard* to support. We expect there to be a number of quirks with the\\ beta. Please help us …",
