      "machineText": "最后，我要特别感谢所有[项目赞助者](/credits/#sponsors)，他们的支持在幕后以多种方式推动着项目发展。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "Finally, I'd like to give a special thank you to all the\\ [project sponsors](/credits/#sponsors) who…",
