      "machineText": "项目即将迈入令人兴奋的新阶段，我期待看到大家使用 Wails 构建出怎样的作品！",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "I look forward to seeing what people build with Wails in this next exciting\\ phase of the project!",
